# Agent A (branding and shell) -- export_presets.cfg, for the lead. OPTIONAL
# but recommended; the icons in the preset's own slots are already replaced
# in place under res://assets/icon/ios/ and res://assets/icons/android/, so the
# iOS and Android exports pick up the new art with NO change here.
#
# Two loose ends the slots do not cover:
#
#   1. [preset.0] icons/icon_1024x1024 still points at the OLD root
#      res://icon_1024.png (the milk bottle). Point it at the new App Store
#      icon so every slot is the same picture.
#   2. The iOS launch storyboard shows a flat cream before Godot's own boot
#      splash. Handing it the same bootSplash.png (Scale to Fit, same cream
#      behind) makes launch -> boot splash -> splash scene one continuous
#      picture. Untested on a device tonight: apply only if there is time to
#      look at it once on the iPad; the plain cream storyboard is a safe
#      fallback and is what ships if this hunk is skipped.

--- a/game/export_presets.cfg
+++ b/game/export_presets.cfg
@@ [preset.0.options]
-icons/icon_1024x1024="res://icon_1024.png"
+icons/icon_1024x1024="res://assets/icon/ios/icon_1024.png"
 storyboard/use_launch_screen_storyboard=true
-storyboard/image_scale_mode=0
-storyboard/custom_image@2x=""
-storyboard/custom_image@3x=""
+storyboard/image_scale_mode=2
+storyboard/custom_image@2x="res://assets/branding/bootSplash.png"
+storyboard/custom_image@3x="res://assets/branding/bootSplash.png"
 storyboard/use_custom_bg_color=true
 storyboard/custom_bg_color=Color(1, 0.964706, 0.878431, 1)
